What:  AutoConfig Migration Utlity - autoconfig_converter.py

Why:  Convert program and project's config.jsonproto to Starlark.

How:  Usages -
1.  /src/project/rex$ python autoconfig_converter.py -j ./screebo
2.  /src/project/rex$ python autoconfig_converter.py --verify -j ./screebo

Feature:
1. Converts signer config data into "signer_config.star" file under program boxster repo.
2. Converts component config data into "components_config.star" file under project boxster repo.
3. Converts fw versions config data into "fw_version_config.star" file under project boxster repo.

"--verify" option turns on running the verification tests after generating the Starlark files, to check
that there is no difference in generated config data after convertion.
